---
// ACT 7 · DEPLOY TOGGLE — cloud/self-host (controller swaps #depDiag).
---
<section style="position:relative; padding:0 28px 150px; border-top:1px solid #1c1c1e; padding-top:120px;">
  <div style="max-width:1080px; margin:0 auto; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr)); gap:48px; align-items:center;">
    <div data-reveal>
      <h2 style="margin:0; font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,34px); font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Your keys. Your machine.</h2>
      <p style="font-size:14px; color:#a9a9a2; line-height:1.7; margin-top:16px; max-width:420px;">BYOK in encrypted storage. The same screens whether you run on our cloud or self-host the single binary — only where the keys live changes.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:24px; display:inline-flex; border:1px solid #3a3a3c;">
        <button id="depCloud" role="switch" aria-checked="true" data-cursor style="font-size:13px; padding:9px 18px; border:0; cursor:pointer; background:#6cf0a8; color:#0a0a0b;">cloud</button>
        <button id="depSelf" role="switch" aria-checked="false" data-cursor style="font-size:13px; padding:9px 18px; border:0; cursor:pointer; background:transparent; color:#e6e6e1;">self-host</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal style="border:1px solid #1c1c1e; padding:24px; background:#08110d;">
      <pre id="depDiag" style="margin:0; font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.8; color:#a9a9a2;"></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
